      "content": "breathing doesnt really help though. it's not just a temporary thing, it's like... everything is just permanent noise. i feel like i'm constantly on edge and i can't escape it. i just want a way to make it stop for good. like, i need a real, actual silence that isn't just a pause between things. does that make sense?",
